                <content>
                  <p><b><i>registered provider</i></b> has the same meaning as in the <i>Aged Care Act 2024</i>.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>Subsection 6(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “approved providers”, substitute “registered providers”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
