              <num>6</num>
              <heading>Section 9 (heading)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “<b>approved providers</b>”, substitute “<b>registered providers</b>”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7">
              <num>7</num>
              <heading>Section 9</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “approved providers” (wherever occurring), substitute “registered providers”.</p>
